258
00:16:31,130 --> 00:16:38,050
So this thing that you have to play only guitar, then not everyone can play guitar, that's the reason.

259
00:16:38,130 --> 00:16:40,937
Not everyone can do this, that's the reason.

260
00:16:41,017 --> 00:16:44,937
But people don't understand. They think that this is free.

261
